  <item>
    <title>E02 吟游诗人——中世纪的天选牛马</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f9239b6764957079312aaf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65f9239b6764957079312aaf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Mar 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2023年底，我们在公众号「局部气候调查组」上开启了一个 史诗级连载：「吟游诗人」这个神秘的中世纪职业。由于文章篇幅限制，很多有意思的事儿没能在文章中展现，总觉得不够尽兴，于是我们特地开了本期播客来大聊特聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>图文连载在这里，请欣赏👇</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wTCCrm1x83AaEeX8E_gGGA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wTCCrm1x83AaEeX8E_gGGA"><span>「吟游诗人（上）」</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wTCCrm1x83AaEeX8E_gGGA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/wTCCrm1x83AaEeX8E_gGGA"><span>「吟游诗人（中）」</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间戳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">1:10</a> 我们对于吟游诗人的初始印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="237">3:57</a> 三种吟游诗人：1）“小仆人”吟游诗人，minstrel；2）宫廷里唱情歌的吟游诗人，troubadour；3）游戏里会魅术的吟游诗人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">6:52</a> 我们的主角——“小仆人”吟游诗人的工作：为所有人做奴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">9:03</a> 中世纪武功歌的代表作品——《罗兰之歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a> 中世纪的乙方——吟游诗人，他们是如何做公关，如何做营销，如何做广告的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a> 吟游诗人接活流程&amp;吟游诗人行会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> 吟游诗人的基本技能：边走路，边弹琴，边唱歌。那他们都弹的什么琴呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">22:04</a> 被教会批判的吟游诗人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1436">23:56</a> 吟游诗人“淫乱”名声的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1567">26:07</a> 中世纪“婚闹”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a> 中世纪大学的“毕业游行”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2037">33:57</a> 因为收入微薄，只能大搞副业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> “黑死病”的阴影下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2432">40:32</a> 中世纪洗浴文化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2515">41:55</a> 贵族出生的吟游诗人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2711">45:11</a> 消失的女性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2804">46:44</a> 《巫师3》里的吟唱</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>口误更正：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>开头聊到的游戏叫《隐迹渐现》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>制作人员名单：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：毛天骅，小龙</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小噗</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：毛天骅</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jesse Hopkins - General CAS 3</span></p><span></span><p><span>John Debney - Arise, Watcher</span></p><span></span><p><span>Erik Bye - Rolandskvadet</span></p><span></span><p><span>John Debney - General Map</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jesse Hopkins - lords hall swadian</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jordi Savall - A chantar m'er de so</span></p><span></span><p><span>Emma Hiddleston - The Wolven Storm</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>提到的游戏：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>博德之门 3</span></p><span></span><p><span>pentiment/隐迹渐现</span></p><span></span><p><span>巫师3：狂猎</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>其他中世纪风格游戏安利：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（来自主播小龙的倾情推荐）</span></p><span></span><p><span>神笔谈兵：手抄本风格策略游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>圣殿春秋：文本量巨大，剧情丰富，（且steam正在春促打折）</span></p><span></span><p><span>八方旅人1&amp;2：不必多言</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmJRsF_vjLDuTscnd_pFy5D3D53i.m4a" length="73832997" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZrT2t0WjZpYXZIYjZpUTh6R2hLV0FtS3VFS2kucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E01 鸟 人 鸟 事 plus</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64bfa18db3f6c440a8032b62</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64bfa18db3f6c440a8032b62</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jul 2023 14:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你喜欢鸟类吗？你观察过身边那些隐藏在草丛树冠里的身影吗？你能从都市的喧嚣中，分辨出此起彼伏的啁啾鸟啼吗？你会愿意为了一睹鸟类的身影，去到人迹罕至的荒野吗？让我们从最基本的观鸟101开始，聊一聊那些与鸟类有关的有趣经历与知识。</span></p><span></span><p><span>飞过你头顶的雨燕，也许跨越了亚非大陆，跋涉过环球之旅才来到你的屋檐；科幻和恐怖片中的诡秘音效，原来都是来自这一种貌不惊人的鸟类；这些不知名的偏僻城镇，却是观鸟者心目中的圣地……</span></p><span></span><p><span>谈话之余，</span><strong><span>本期播客特别放送身临其境的鸟类鸣叫配音，让你足不出户体验空灵鸟语。</span></strong><span>也许燃起对鸟类和自然的热爱，就在这一刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>敬请聆听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Paweł Górniak - The Opening (Original Video Game Soundtrack)</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cosmo Sheldrake - Cuckoo</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期观鸟长图：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ccAXJtbyeyRwq0ID2lvQzA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ccAXJtbyeyRwq0ID2lvQzA"><span>鸟 人 鸟 事</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>2.</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ccAXJtbyeyRwq0ID2lvQzA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ccAXJtbyeyRwq0ID2lvQzA"><span>天上有个“人”</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>提到的鸟：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.白头鹎</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjHe9G0TkmKdb1psN3oi9kHoqg24.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>2.大斑啄木鸟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnssQa75Ho-VdOhyi1Xk367pnrTo.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>3.东方大苇莺</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqzN5q61jvEutqf3NhLv6wZXmP1j.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>4.大杜鹃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnZTq3TXVq_WTb5LpadZpbxfHTBO.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>5.四声杜鹃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhITVNfjM_D7e6ph3v_wD1nSZff4.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>6.八声杜鹃</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fudwdkm74IBs0OlCtm7LYbNADSsI.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>7.朱鹮</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqNTGfm9bQ5CPMQQ0sQsmreMzMtu.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>8.强脚树莺</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnVUrrjKQVPnUk2aBTktc-MAvyRg.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>9.华丽琴鸟（在节目中口误说成了“澳大利亚蜂鸟”抱歉抱歉～就是那个会模仿电锯、婴儿声的模仿大师！）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmnoPZM4-8uB5rJ5wMYxoYrPO8bg.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>10.普通潜鸟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtpWz4BM9JUM9sNJfMw7Kek2nbCQ.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>11.珠颈斑鸠</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtaHk957dsicPT2-IcgtoLj1UAuv.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>其它：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.鸟书推荐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkjs5Nt7nIygNnB-mZycHGctyro7.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2.助你懂鸟小程序</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrOJGcSPoBDAQ598LLbBaL6qs_f2.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>3.中国观鸟记录中心</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkdF25HE1JT9YQEWJGrSyJhgoy74.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>4.小拉在观鸟记录中心的观鸟记录（部分）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqpvbGw7Ef-fDZnEy8fSHk8MrWi9.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>5.电影《观鸟大年》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiNprg8tvsdBPUzCa2E_QrqsfiWz.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>6.鸟类卡牌游戏《wingspan》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgIOx7aJw8bwRcd84kHp6a9eNId9.png"></figure>]]></description>
